{
  "info": {
    "name": "ClipForge 自动出片 API v1",
    "description": "按00–09顺序接入。所有值均为占位符。导入环境模板并在本机填写凭证。07创建会使用积分，默认跳过，显式开启仅发送一次。集合不自动重试或轮询，不包含千川接口；TikTok发布使用独立HMAC凭证。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 查询租户 ID",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin-api/system/tenant/get-id-by-name?name={{tenantNameEncoded}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin-api",
            "system",
            "tenant",
            "get-id-by-name"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "value": "{{tenantNameEncoded}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "先填写 tenantName；data=null 时联系管理员，不要猜测其他租户。",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set(\"tenantNameEncoded\", encodeURIComponent(pm.environment.get(\"tenantName\") || \"\"));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP successful\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));",
              "const result = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Business code is 0\", () => pm.expect(result.code, result.msg).to.eql(0));",
              "if (result.code === 0 && result.data != null) {",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"tenantId\", String(result.data));",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "01 账号登录",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "tenant-id",
            "value": "{{tenantId}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin-api/system/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin-api",
            "system",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "用户名为真实登录账号，不是昵称。启用验证码的环境需先按原登录流程获取 captchaVerification；此集合不绕过验证码。令牌保存到当前本机环境，导出前清空。",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const login = {username: pm.environment.get(\"username\"), password: pm.environment.get(\"password\")};",
              "const captcha = pm.environment.get(\"captchaVerification\");",
              "if (captcha) login.captchaVerification = captcha;",
              "pm.request.body.update(JSON.stringify(login));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP successful\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));",
              "const result = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Business code is 0\", () => pm.expect(result.code, result.msg).to.eql(0));",
              "if (result.code === 0 && result.data != null) {",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", result.data.accessToken);",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", result.data.refreshToken);",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"expiresTime\", String(result.data.expiresTime));",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "02 刷新令牌",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "tenant-id",
            "value": "{{tenantId}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin-api/system/auth/refresh-token?refreshToken={{refreshTokenEncoded}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin-api",
            "system",
            "auth",
            "refresh-token"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "refreshToken",
              "value": "{{refreshTokenEncoded}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "刷新成功自动替换两种令牌。刷新失效重新登录；不要将带刷新令牌的 URL 共享或写入日志。",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set(\"refreshTokenEncoded\", encodeURIComponent(pm.environment.get(\"refreshToken\") || \"\"));"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP successful\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299));",
              "const result = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"Business code is 0\", () => pm.expect(result.code, result.msg).to.eql(0));",
              "if (result.code === 0 && result.data != null) {",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", result.data.accessToken);",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", result.data.refreshToken);",
              "  pm.environment.set(\"expiresTime\", String(result.data.expiresTime));",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
